  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two spherical objects, A and B, are fired with the same initial velocity at an angle  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> to the horizontal as shown on the diagram. The objects have the same radius. The density of object A is larger than the density of object B. Air resistance is negligible. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is true about the height reached by A and B and the time that it takes for A and B to hit the ground?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Height reached by A and B</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Time taken to hit the ground by A and B</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Same</td>\n<td>Different</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Different</td>\n<td>Same</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Same</td>\n<td>Same</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Different</td>\n<td>Different</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
